# Template for the dashboard env files. Copy to .env.production (or .env.staging)
# and fill in the values, then keep the filled file OUT of git (both are gitignored).
#
# VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY is RLS-gated and public-safe, but it still belongs only in
# the untracked env files so the repo carries no environment-specific config.
# TURNSTILE_SECRET_KEY is a real secret and must never be committed.
#
# verify-env.mjs checks (at build time) that the URL ref and the anon JWT ref match
# the target project and that the JWT role is "anon", not "service_role".

VITE_SUPABASE_URL=
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
TURNSTILE_SECRET_KEY=
